# Fly.io builds deploy/brouter/Dockerfile with the repo root as its context
# (docs/brouter-self-host-runbook.md). Only the profiles and the deploy
# scripts belong in that context; everything else would be uploaded for
# nothing (node_modules alone is hundreds of MB).
*
!routing-profiles/
!routing-profiles/*.brf
!deploy/
!deploy/brouter/
!deploy/brouter/*.sh
!deploy/brouter/Dockerfile
